<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Elio Hbeich"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Riina Maigre"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Tarmo Robal"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "MODULE: IDENT\nIdentifier module of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project.\n\nThe Identifier module proposes an universal approach for identifiers used in the EU DPP CO delivered by the CIRPASS-2 European Project.  \nThe module describes identifiers used for the project through aspects and scheme references, if appropriate, granularity is added.\n---\n\nDESIGN RESTRICTION: Specific modules of the EU DPP CO need to use the Connector to establish a link to the Identifiers module. The link needs to be establsihed to a subclass of aIdentifier class, e.g., Product hasUniqueProductIdentifier ProductIdentifier.\n---\n\nDEPENDENCIES: This module may have dependencies to all  EU DPP Core Ontology (CO) modules that use different types of identifiers, including: CON, P_DPP, SOC, ACTOR, ...  \n--\n\nTHIS DOCUMENT IS PROVIDED WITH NO WARRANTIES WHATSOEVER. \nAll liability for any damages arising from use or misuse of this vocabulary is with the user."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-10-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. \nIn case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "The Identifier (IDENT) module of the EU DPP core ontology proposed by the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "ident" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Identifier module (IDENT) of the EU DPP core ontology proposal of the CIRPASS-2 European project."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EU DPP IDENT"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/IDENT> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.2.0" .
